 "retained_failures": [
  "scenario-delay-13: ownership registered after the modeled BOOT press 13 s after connecting, then 'Disconnecting unauthenticated client after timeout' before the client's claim and authentication. Present at 50aaf9b1 and still at f37a084f: esp32/lib/ble_navigation/ble_navigation.cpp:7535-7547 (and the maintenance-boot copy at 7433-7434) allows 120 s only while a pairing code is pending, then 12 s from the original lastConnectMs. Firmware, not emulator; not fixed here.",
  "touch, before 7ce4819f: on clean 3928b387 a 10-second run tapping at 7.3/7.6 s (actions.txt sha256 50b723ac62df8cafe68292fd6033a1ceca0a60299c6028f05b313d6b1783c7bb) failed the new touch_contact_read check with touch_contact_reads=0 (emulator.log sha256 95f9a26542e2e2dc42951cde7332f2f416a8ef3252464b4fd4b2aa121aee7a91, serial.log sha256 cc860c4b7360a3abadebb639c8a078c40cb3ed8bdf003a1fe2f06db9be5e81b0); examples/bicino175/touch.txt failed the same way on a dirty tree at 6d860b64. The board raised the CST9217 interrupt on GPIO21; firmware since open-bike-computer 73d2f9ad reads touch only after the GPIO11 edge. Fixed in 7ce4819f: nine contact reads for both scripts.",
  "run-negative-0.1s: a 0.1-second capture fails readiness and returns 1, as intended.",
  "run-blank-card: an unformatted card fails sd_mounted (FatFs finds no file system; the firmware's SPI fallback and FFat follow) and the run returns 1, as intended."
 ],
 "limitations": [
  "Synthetic ATT client and emulated SoC; no iPhone, radio, physical board, power or timing claim.",
  "SD bus untimed on the S3; ideal card; copy-on-write image. The map selection is a hand-written session-less active-map.json, not an app-installed durable map: no transfer, receipt or signature path runs.",
  "Wall times are single runs on a shared host under other sessions' load; not performance measurements.",
  "Raw logs, screenshots, firmware and images stay in ignored .local storage; only their hashes are here."
 ]
